@startuml 02-parallel-workflow-comparison
!theme plain
title Parallel Workflow Comparison - Frontend vs Webhook
footer Sprint 10 Analysis - 2025-12-05

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor white
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFACD
}

' Color scheme
skinparam swimlane {
    BorderColor black
}

|#90EE90| Frontend Flow |
|#87CEEB| Webhook Flow |
|#DDA0DD| Contract State |
|#FFB6C1| oxorder State |

|Frontend Flow|
start
:User returns from Stripe;
:StripeCheckoutReturnEvent;
:Validate session + token;
:PaymentAuthorizedEvent;

|Contract State|
:DRAFT → PENDING;
:Fulfill payment_authorized;
:PENDING → READY_TO_COMMIT;
:ContractReadyToCommitEvent;

|Frontend Flow|
:StripeOrderCreationHandler;
:Create order via finalizeOrder();

|oxorder State|
:Order created;
note right #FFA500
OXPAID = '0000-00-00'
OXTRANSSTATUS = 'OK'
OXTRANSID = pi_xxx
end note

|Contract State|
:READY_TO_COMMIT → COMMITTED;
:Contract linked to order;

|Frontend Flow|
:Redirect to thankyou;
:User sees order confirmation;

|Webhook Flow|
:payment_intent.succeeded webhook;
note right
May arrive 1-60 seconds
after user returns
end note

:WebhookProcessingService;
:Find contract by pi_xxx;

|Contract State|
if (Contract found?) then (yes)
  :COMMITTED → FULFILLED;
else (no)
  :Legacy fallback;
endif

|Webhook Flow|
:updateOrderFieldsAfterContractFulfillment();

|oxorder State|
:UPDATE OXPAID = NOW();
note right #90EE90
**OXPAID finally set!**
Only happens if webhook
arrives and succeeds
end note

|Webhook Flow|
stop

@enduml
